{"id":"n62840-1-21","stage":1,"title":"다리 · 腿","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62840-1-21-1","ko":"왜 절뚝거리면서 걸으세요?","zh":"您为什么一瘸一拐地走路？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"절뚝거리면서","meaning":"一瘸一拐","explanation":"절뚝거리다：一瘸一拐；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"절뚝거리다","audio":"/audio/216c0fc0ca00433b7527.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83409","senseId":"1","lemma":"절뚝거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절뚝거리면서","audio":"/audio/2da20250bb13634b303b.mp3"}},{"text":"걸으세요?","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸으세요","audio":"/audio/1040878934619e5c9a4b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"216c0fc0ca00433b","term":"절뚝거리다","zh":"一瘸一拐","audio":"/audio/216c0fc0ca00433b7527.mp3","entryId":"83409","definition":"一侧腿短或受伤而总是失去重心，跛着腿走。","pronunciation":["절뚝꺼리다"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/802498e464a81320480a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62840-1-21-2","ko":"어제 운동을 하다 다리를 조금 다쳤어요.","zh":"昨天锻炼的时候腿受了点伤。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"하다","meaning":"做、进行（운동을 하다：锻炼）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（운동을 하다：锻炼）；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}},{"text":"다리를","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다리를","audio":"/audio/7a6c8a5ead7401edfd16.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳤어요.","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳤어요","audio":"/audio/e7282a37d6023168f260.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b